X:11
T:The Braes of Bushbie
R:strathspey
C:John Bowie, 1789
N:This famous Scottish strathspey first appeared in John Bowie's
K:C
Collection
(1789).
N:In that book it is unclear if Bowie composed the tune or not ... I
suspect he did.
N:Over the years it has been rearranged into a famous reel, Dowd's
Favourite
N:which was first recorded by Michael Coleman in the twenties.
N:Jerry plays both settings. He learned the Cape Breton strathspey
setting
N:from Bill Lamey.
