%%textfont Helvetica 10
%%begintext
R&O 2009, version 4
%%endtext
%%textfont Helvetica 12
%%begintext align left

A Scottish country dance exists for this tune.
John Bannerman Milne (who died in 1968) played cello in a band with this 
tune's composer.  Milne owned a movie theater (Bannerman House) in South 
Tay Street, Dundee.  Dance available at http://my.strathspey.org/dd/dance/3172/
%%endtext
% Source: sources/harbormist-com/tunes1/abc.zip/abc/J_B_Milne.txt.abc

